<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>自定义CSS编辑器</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f5f6f7;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-primary: #1a1a1a;
            --text-secondary: #666666;
            --text-light: #999999;
            --accent-green: #2ecc71; /* Approximate green from screenshot */
            --border-color: #eaeaea;
            --font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-family);
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden; /* Prevent body scroll, handle inside container */
        }

        /* Status Bar Simulation */
        .status-bar {
            height: 44px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            background-color: var(--bg-color); /* Matches screenshot bg */
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .status-icons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .battery {
            width: 25px;
            height: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 3px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .battery::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: -4px;
            top: 3px;
            width: 2px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #333;
            border-radius: 0 1px 1px 0;
        }
        .battery-level {
            width: 85%;
            height: 100%;
            background: #333;
            border-radius: 1.5px 0 0 1.5px;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            padding: 10px 16px;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }
        .back-btn {
            position: absolute;
            left: 16px;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #000;
            cursor: pointer;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Tabs */
        .tabs-container {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .tab-item {
            padding: 12px 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            position: relative;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .tab-item.active {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .tab-pill {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Main Content Scroll Area */
        main {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 16px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* Card */
        .editor-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
        }

        /* Card Header */
        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .header-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #111;
        }
        .code-icon {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: #2ecc71;
        }
        .header-right {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .icon-btn {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #f7f8fa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #555;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .icon-btn svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        /* Code Editor Visual */
        .code-editor {
            background-color: #fafafa;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            min-height: 280px;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        .comment { color: #888; }
        .keyword { color: #d73a49; } /* Not strictly used in screenshot text but good for realism */

        /* Template Section */
        .template-section {
            margin-top: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .template-icon {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: #2ecc71;
        }

        /* Action Buttons */
        .action-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:active { opacity: 0.8; }
        .btn-clear {
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            color: #333;
        }
        .btn-apply {
            background-color: var(--accent-green);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3);
        }
        .btn svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        /* My Themes Section */
        .my-themes {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #222;
        }
        .section-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #999;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Status Bar -->
    <div class="status-bar">
        <span>11:47</span>
        <div class="status-icons">
            <!-- Signal -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="#333">
                <path d="M2 22h20V2z"></path> <!-- Simplified notch representation -->
            </svg>
            <!-- Wifi -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="#333">
                <path d="M1 9l2 2c4.97-4.97 13.03-4.97 18 0l2-2C16.93 2.93 7.08 2.93 1 9zm8 8l3 3 3-3c-1.65-1.66-4.34-1.66-6 0zm-4-4l2 2c2.76-2.76 7.24-2.76 10 0l2-2C15.14 9.14 8.87 9.14 5 13z"/>
            </svg>
            <!-- Battery -->
            <div class="battery"><div class="battery-level"></div></div>
            <span style="font-size: 12px;">100%</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="back-btn">&lt;</div>
        <h1>主题</h1>
    </header>

    <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
    <nav class="tabs-container">
        <div class="tab-item">主题</div>
        <div class="tab-item">气泡</div>
        <div class="tab-pill">自定义CSS</div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>
        <div class="editor-card">

            <!-- Editor Header -->
            <div class="card-header">
                <div class="header-left">
                    <!-- Code Icon SVG -->
                    <svg class="code-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M9.4 16.6L4.8 12l4.6-4.6L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.4-1.4zm5.2 0l4.6-4.6-4.6-4.6L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.4-1.4z"/>
                    </svg>
                    自定义 CSS
                </div>
                <div class="header-right">
                    <div class="icon-btn" title="Save">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 3H5c-1.11 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V7l-4-4zm-5 16c-1.66 0-3-1.34-3-3s1.34-3 3-3 3 1.34 3 3-1.34 3-3 3zm3-10H5V5h10v4z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-btn" title="Copy">
                         <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 1H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14h2V3h12V1zm3 4H8c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h11c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V7c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H8V7h11v14z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Code Text Area Simulation -->
            <div class="code-editor">
<span class="comment">/* 
====================================================
 微信 · 模板 (全部界面 · 逐项列出)
====================================================


 作用范围：整台手机，按界面分节：
   — 聊天界面（气泡/输入栏/按钮/图标/面板/菜单）

   二 聊天卡片（红包/转账/亲属卡/礼物/代付/——张=钱）
      — 红包/转账/发票卡/画面
*/</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Template Button -->
            <div class="template-section">
                <svg class="template-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                   <path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H5V5h14v14zm-7-2h2v-4h4v-2h-4V7h-2v4H8v2h4z"/> <!-- Simplified layout icon -->
                </svg>
                模板
            </div>

            <!-- Buttons -->
            <div class="action-row">
                <button class="btn btn-clear">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 6.41L17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z"/></svg>
                    清除
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-apply">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
                    应用
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- My Themes Info -->
        <section class="my-themes">
            <h2 class="section-title">我的主题</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">还没有保存的主题——写好 CSS 后点右上角保存按钮，就会出现在这里</p>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
